  "title": "· This Week's New Bags · LOEWE Holiday Lights Bucket Bag & Clutch, LV Purple Papillon Trunk Cylinder Case & Trompe-L'œil Keepall Travel Bag",
  "original_title": "一周新包 | LOEWE 圣诞彩灯装饰水桶包 & 手拿包，LV 紫色 Papillon Trunk 圆筒手提箱 & 错视印花 Keepall 旅行袋",
  "excerpt": "Loewe launches two Christmas-themed bags with colored light-bulb details: a woven Garland bucket bag and a beaded Flamenco clutch.",
