    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LOEWE launches a pair of light-bulb-accented bags this week, perfectly timed for the fast-approaching Christmas season. The Garland bucket bag is hand-woven from contrasting black and white nappa calfskin, and its standout feature is a ring of translucent colored resin bulbs dangling around the body — much like the twinkling ornaments on a Christmas tree. The Flamenco Purse clutch is crafted from soft knit fabric and embroidered all over with black and white beadwork; at the ends of the leather drawstrings on either side, tiny colored light bulbs replace the classic knot detail, cleverly setting a festive mood.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
