      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Papillon Trunk ingeniously fuses the retro cylindrical silhouette of the Papillon with the iconic trunk construction of the Boite Chapeau. Crafted from textured calfskin into a rounded hard-case form, it features reinforced side straps and metal rivets along the body that carry on traditional trunk codes, while a rounded gold S-lock clasp at the center adds a modern touch. Rendered in romantic lavender purple, the bag feels just like the carry-on case of a vintage screen siren.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
