    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Keepall Bandoulière 45 travel bag comes from LV's Resort 2027 collection. Set against classic monogram canvas, the body is printed with a medley of travel essentials — passports, a sleep mask, headphones, key charms and more — as if the bag's private contents were laid bare on the outside, using trompe-l'œil printing to deliver a playful spirit.",
